<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1381723556"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1468037776"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Call your name &lt;Gv&gt;"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="澤野弘之 / R!N/Gemie"/><amll:meta key="album" value="「進撃の巨人」Season3 オリジナルサウンドトラック"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:40.970"><div begin="00:13.670" end="03:40.970"><p begin="00:13.670" end="00:19.510" itunes:key="L1">She lost her brother a month ago<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">几个月前 她失去了她的哥哥</span></p><p begin="00:19.510" end="00:26.760" itunes:key="L2">His picture on a wall, and it reminds me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而他的照片还挂在墙上</span></p><p begin="00:26.760" end="00:32.180" itunes:key="L3">When she brings me coffee, her smile<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当她为我端上一杯咖啡 那笑靥如花</span></p><p begin="00:32.180" end="00:39.600" itunes:key="L4">I wish I could be with her 'til my last day<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这时我多希望能和她永远在一起 直到我生命的尽头</span></p><p begin="00:39.600" end="00:46.170" itunes:key="L5">She said she gave all her love to me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她说她把所有的爱都献给了我</span></p><p begin="00:46.170" end="00:53.100" itunes:key="L6">We dreamt a new life, some place to be at peace<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们也曾梦想过在某个和平之地</span></p><p begin="00:53.100" end="00:58.130" itunes:key="L7">But things changed, suddenly<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然而这一切发生得太快 转瞬之间</span></p><p begin="00:58.130" end="01:05.310" itunes:key="L8">I lost my dreams in this disaster<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">残酷的浩劫 将我的梦想毁得七零八碎</span></p><p begin="01:05.310" end="01:10.710" itunes:key="L9">I'm crying, missing my lover<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我放声痛哭</span></p><p begin="01:10.710" end="01:19.080" itunes:key="L10">I don't have that power on my side forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经没有活下去的勇气了</span></p><p begin="01:19.080" end="01:28.700" itunes:key="L11">Oh, where is my lover? And I got no power<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 我的爱人 你在哪里</span></p><p begin="01:28.700" end="01:35.950" itunes:key="L12">I'm standing alone, no way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今一个人孤独的站着 不知该何去何从</span></p><p begin="01:35.950" end="01:43.490" itunes:key="L13">Calling out your name<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只能不断地呼唤着你的名字</span></p><p begin="01:59.050" end="02:04.750" itunes:key="L14">I said I gave all my love to you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我说过我会把所有的爱给你</span></p><p begin="02:04.750" end="02:11.850" itunes:key="L15">We dreamt a new house, some place to be at peace<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们也曾梦想过在某个平和之处</span></p><p begin="02:11.850" end="02:17.180" itunes:key="L16">But things changed, suddenly<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然而这一切发生得太快 转瞬之间</span></p><p begin="02:17.180" end="02:24.020" itunes:key="L17">I lost my dreams in this disaster<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">残酷的浩劫 将我的梦想毁得七零八碎</span></p><p begin="02:24.020" end="02:30.420" itunes:key="L18">We don't know what is wrong tonight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们都不知道今晚到底出了什么差错</span></p><p begin="02:30.420" end="02:37.030" itunes:key="L19">Everybody's got no place to hide<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只是所有人都无处可藏</span></p><p begin="02:37.030" end="02:43.680" itunes:key="L20">No one's left, and there's no one to go on<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">到了最后 无人离开 亦无人愿意继续向前走</span></p><p begin="02:43.680" end="03:03.930" itunes:key="L21">All I know is my life is gone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我所知道的只是 我的生活已不复存在</span></p><p begin="03:03.930" end="03:09.100" itunes:key="L22">I'm crying, missing my lover<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我放声痛哭</span></p><p begin="03:09.100" end="03:17.420" itunes:key="L23">I don't have that power on my side forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经没有活下去的勇气了</span></p><p begin="03:17.420" end="03:27.130" itunes:key="L24">Oh, where is my lover? And I got no power<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 我的爱人 你在哪里</span></p><p begin="03:27.130" end="03:34.580" itunes:key="L25">I'm standing alone, no way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今一个人孤独的站着 不知该何去何从</span></p><p begin="03:34.580" end="03:40.970" itunes:key="L26">Calling out your name<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只能不断地呼唤着你的名字</span></p></div></body></tt>